SUMMARY:UBC Work on Campus Fair 2026
DESCRIPTION:Are you looking for an on-campus job this September? \nCome to the UBC Work on Campus Fair! \nThe event will be held at the UBC Life Building Concourse on July 29 from 11:00 AM to 2:00 PM.  \nThe UBC Work on Campus Fair on July 29\, 2026\, provides opportunities for UBC students to work on or near campus during the academic year. Students will have the chance to connect with UBC on-campus employers\, submit their applications\, and learn more about the positions available. \nWe will continue updating the list of employers attending\, so please keep checking back.
URL:https://events.ubc.ca/event/ubc-work-on-campus-fair-2026/
LOCATION:See Description
