SUMMARY:Opera al fresco
DESCRIPTION:Experience UBC Opera in the Open Air! \nJoin UBC Inspired and UBC Opera on Wednesday\, July 29\, from 4pm-7pm for the inaugural Opera al fresco at Thunderbird Commons!   \nGrab your friends\, pack a blanket\, and bring a picnic to enjoy outside. This family-friendly event starts with pre-show activities at 4:00pm\, followed by a spectacular hour-long performance at 5:30pm featuring student performers from the UBC Opera Ensemble\, accompanied by a live pianist.  \nEntry is FREE\, but space is limited—arrive early to secure your spot!  \nFor full event details and the option to register for event updates\, please visit: inspired.ubc.ca/opera 
